SETUP:

Setup is simple.  

     1  Unzip all files to there appropriate directories (zipped with
        directory subdirs), add "ASSASSIN" to your pfiles, and run it
        to initialize the game.

     2  Add CLOG.cron as a bbsevent.  It updates the city logs so they
        don't overwhelm your drive!

     3  Send your shareware registration donation, (HEY!  I need to make a
        living to!)  suggested $15-$25.

 
			Thank you for your support!  

